"id":"guanzhang-m-p003-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p003"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o030-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o030"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p012-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p012"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o057-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o057"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p030-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p030"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p015-wudi-p0178","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p015"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o043-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o043"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o002-wudi-p0178","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及张辽","evidence":["wgc-q0002"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"八月，登白狼山〖11〗，猝与虏遇〖12〗。众甚盛。公车重在后，被甲者少〖13〗；左右皆惧。公登高，望虏阵不整，乃纵兵击之，使张辽为先锋；虏众大崩；斩蹋顿及名王以下〖14〗，胡、汉降者二十余万口。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97},{"id":"zhangle-e-o001a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"少为郡吏。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":36},{"id":"zhangle-e-o001b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"汉末，并州刺史丁原，以辽武力过人，召为从事。使将兵诣京都。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":65},{"id":"zhangle-e-o001c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"何进遣诣河北募兵，得千余人。还，进败，以兵属董卓。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":65,"end":90},{"id":"zhangle-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-b7ce46d814e6691fc913","layer":"original","quote":"卓败，以兵属吕布。迁骑都尉。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"zhangle-e-o002b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-b7ce46d814e6691fc913","layer":"original","quote":"布为李傕所败，从布东奔徐州，领鲁相。时年二十八。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":38},{"id":"zhangle-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2e46a837d8e6474824c2","layer":"original","quote":"太祖破吕布于下邳，辽将其众降；拜中郎将，赐爵关内侯。数有战功，迁裨将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36},{"id":"zhangle-e-o003c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2e46a837d8e6474824c2","layer":"original","quote":"与夏侯渊围昌豨于东海，数月粮尽，议引军还。辽谓渊曰：“数日以来，每行诸围〖3〗，豨辄属目视辽；又其射矢更豨，此必豨计犹豫，故不力战。辽欲挑与语，傥可诱也〖4〗。”乃使谓豨曰：“公有命，使辽传之！”豨果下，与辽语，辽为说：“太祖神武，方以德怀四方，先附者受大赏。”豨乃许降。辽遂单身上三公山〖5〗，入豨家，拜妻子〖6〗；豨欢喜，随诣太祖。太祖遣豨还，责辽曰：“此非大将法也！”辽谢曰：“以明公威信著于四海，辽奉圣旨，豨必不敢害故也。”","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":266},{"id":"zhangle-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-bb2000f2e2cf52ea36fc","layer":"original","quote":"从讨袁谭、袁尚于黎阳，有功，行中坚将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhangle-e-o004d-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-bb2000f2e2cf52ea36fc","layer":"original","quote":"从攻袁谭。谭破，别将徇海滨，破辽东贼柳毅等。还邺，太祖自出迎辽，引共载。以辽为荡寇将军，","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":86,"end":130},{"id":"zhangle-e-o006a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-9b40d24a36cd03bdca79","layer":"original","quote":"时荆州未定，复遣辽屯长社。临发，军中有谋反者，夜惊乱起火，一军尽扰。辽谓左右曰：“勿动！是不一营尽反〖1〗，必有造变者，欲以动乱人耳。”乃令军中：其不反者安坐。辽将亲兵数十人，中阵而立。有顷，定，即得首谋者，杀之。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107},{"id":"zhangle-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-540c45abdbf8dfcd0bc0","layer":"original","quote":"灊中有天柱山〖4〗，高峻二十余里；道险狭，步径才通〖5〗。兰等壁其上，辽欲进，诸将曰：“兵少道险，难用深入。”辽曰：“此所谓一与一〖6〗，勇者得前耳。”遂进到山下安营，攻之。斩兰、成首，尽虏其众。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":165},{"id":"zhangle-e-o008a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-de092265329b0ffd8021","layer":"original","quote":"太祖既征孙权还，使辽与乐进、李典等，将七千余人屯合肥。太祖征张鲁，教与护军薛悌〖7〗，署函边曰“贼至乃发”。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"zhangle-e-o008b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-de092265329b0ffd8021","layer":"original","quote":"俄而权率十万众，围合肥，乃共发教。教曰：“若孙权至者，张、李将军出战；乐将军守；护军，勿得与战！”诸将皆疑，辽曰：“公远征在外，比救至，彼破我必矣。是以教指及其未合逆击之，折其盛势，以安众心，然后可守也。成败之机，在此一战，诸君何疑！”李典亦与辽同。于是辽夜募敢从之士，得八百人；椎牛飨将士〖8〗，明日大战。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":54,"end":208},{"id":"zhangle-e-o009a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-7aaac17cec433f853374","layer":"original","quote":"平旦〖9〗，辽被甲持戟，先登陷阵；杀数十人，斩二将；大呼自名〖10〗，冲垒入，至权麾下。权大惊，众不知所为；走登高冢，以长戟自守。辽叱权“下战”，权不敢动；望见辽所将众少，乃聚围辽数重。辽左右麾围〖11〗，直前急击；围开，辽将麾下数十人得出。余众号呼曰：“将军弃我乎！”辽复还，突围，拔出余众。权人马皆披靡，无敢当者。自旦战至日中，吴人夺气〖12〗。还修守备，众心乃安，诸将咸服。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190},{"id":"zhangle-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-7aaac17cec433f853374","layer":"original","quote":"权守合肥十余日〖13〗，城不可拔，乃引退。辽率诸军追击，几复获权。太祖大壮辽，拜征东将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":190,"end":235},{"id":"zhangle-e-o010a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-d060eac4284b4deb7d2f","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十一年，太祖复征孙权，到合肥；循行辽战处，叹息者良久。乃增辽兵，多留诸军，徙屯居巢。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"zhangle-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-fbeb459c3107382731c5","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即王位，转前将军；﹝一﹞分封兄汎及一子列侯。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"zhangle-e-o012c-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-fbeb459c3107382731c5","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，封晋阳侯；增邑千户，并前二千六百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":97,"end":120},{"id":"zhangle-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，辽朝洛阳宫。文帝引辽会建始殿，亲问破吴意状〖4〗。帝叹息，顾左右曰：“此亦古之召虎也〖5〗！”为起第舍，又特为辽母作殿；以辽所从破吴军应募步卒，皆为虎贲〖6〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85},{"id":"zhangle-e-o013b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"孙权复称藩，辽还屯雍丘，得疾。帝遣侍中刘晔将太医视疾〖7〗，虎贲问消息，道路相属。疾未瘳，帝迎辽就行在所。车驾亲临，执其手；赐以御衣，太官日送御食。疾小差〖8〗，还屯。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":85,"end":169},{"id":"zhangle-e-o013d-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，辽与诸将破权将吕范。辽病笃，遂薨于江都〖9〗。帝为流涕，谥曰刚侯。子虎嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":214,"end":254},{"id":"zhangle-f0001-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"张辽字文远","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5},{"id":"zhangle-f0002-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"雁门马邑人也","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":6,"end":12},{"id":"zhangle-f0013-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-96070d5724473c2e0ea5","layer":"original","quote":"谥曰刚侯","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":245,"end":249}],"profiles":{"wudi-p0178":{"fields":[{"id":"zhangle-f0001","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"文远","evidence":["zhangle-f0001-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-f0002","key":"home","label":"籍贯","text":"雁门马邑","evidence":["zhangle-f0002-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-f0013","key":"posthumous","label":"谥号","text":"刚侯","evidence":["zhangle-f0013-q"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wei"},"biography":{"stages":[{"id":"early","title":"早年转徙"},{"id":"service","title":"归曹立功"},{"id":"north","title":"北征与平叛"},{"id":"hefei","title":"合肥之战"},{"id":"guard","title":"居巢守御"},{"id":"wei","title":"魏初任职与晚年"},{"id":"appraisal","title":"评说"}],"nodes":[{"id":"junli","stage":"early","title":"由郡吏入军","time_events":["zhangle-e-o001a","zhangle-e-o001b"],"sentences":[{"text":"张辽少时为郡吏。丁原因其武力过人，召为从事，令他领兵前往京都。","events":["zhangle-e-o001a","zhangle-e-o001b"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o001a-q","zhangle-e-o001b-q"]}]},{"id":"recruit","stage":"early","title":"募兵与转徙","time_events":["zhangle-e-o001c"],"sentences":[{"text":"何进遣张辽到河北募兵，得千余人；还军时何进已败，张辽遂率兵归属董卓。","events":["zhangle-e-o001c"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o001c-q"]}]},{"id":"lvbu","stage":"early","title":"随吕布东奔","time_events":["zhangle-e-o002a","zhangle-e-o002b"],"sentences":[{"text":"董卓败后，张辽率兵归属吕布，迁骑都尉。吕布为李傕所败，张辽随之东奔徐州，领鲁相。","events":["zhangle-e-o002a","zhangle-e-o002b"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o002a-q","zhangle-e-o002b-q"]}]},{"id":"surrender","stage":"service","title":"率众归曹","time_events":["zhangle-e-o003a"],"sentences":[{"text":"曹操在下邳击破吕布，张辽率众投降，受拜中郎将、赐爵关内侯，后以战功迁裨将军。","events":["zhangle-e-o003a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o003a-q"]}]},{"id":"changxi","stage":"service","title":"单身劝降昌豨","time_events":["zhangle-e-o003c"],"sentences":[{"text":"围攻昌豨数月后，张辽观察其动向，主动交谈劝降，随后独自入其家中，昌豨随他前往见曹操。曹操责其不合大将之法，张辽以奉曹操威信作答。","events":["zhangle-e-o003c"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o003c-q"]}]},{"id":"yuan","stage":"service","title":"从征袁氏","time_events":["zhangle-e-o004a","zhangle-e-o004d"],"sentences":[{"text":"张辽从攻黎阳有功，行中坚将军；又从攻袁谭，别军击破柳毅等。还邺时曹操亲迎，与之同载，任其为荡寇将军。","events":["zhangle-e-o004a","zhangle-e-o004d"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o004a-q","zhangle-e-o004d-q"]}]},{"id":"bailang","stage":"north","title":"白狼山先锋","time_events":["wudi-e-o115a"],"sentences":[{"text":"曹军在白狼山与乌丸军相遇，曹操观察敌阵不整，令张辽为先锋进击，乌丸军大败，蹋顿等被斩。","events":["wudi-e-o115a"],"evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]}]},{"id":"night","stage":"north","title":"镇定军中夜乱","time_events":["zhangle-e-o006a"],"sentences":[{"text":"出发屯长社前，军中夜惊起火。张辽令不反者安坐，率亲兵数十人立于军中，平定骚动后捕杀首谋者。","events":["zhangle-e-o006a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o006a-q"]}]},{"id":"tianzhu","stage":"north","title":"攻陈兰梅成","time_events":["zhangle-e-o007b"],"sentences":[{"text":"陈兰等据险山，诸将以兵少道险为虑，张辽仍进至山下攻营，斩陈兰、梅成，俘获其众。","events":["zhangle-e-o007b"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o007b-q"]}]},{"id":"garrison","stage":"hefei","title":"留屯合肥","time_events":["zhangle-e-o008a"],"sentences":[{"text":"曹操使张辽与乐进、李典等率七千余人屯合肥，征张鲁时留下密教，约定敌军到来方可开启。","events":["zhangle-e-o008a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o008a-q"]}]},{"id":"eight-hundred","stage":"hefei","title":"夜募八百士","time_events":["zhangle-e-o008b"],"sentences":[{"text":"孙权围合肥，张辽认为应趁敌军尚未合围，先挫其锋以安众心，李典赞同。张辽当夜招募敢从之士八百人，准备次日出战。","events":["zhangle-e-o008b"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]}]},{"id":"breakout","stage":"hefei","title":"突阵与追击","time_events":["wudi-e-o177a"],"sentences":[{"text":"《张辽传》记张辽披甲持戟突入孙权军阵，突围后又返回救出余众；孙权十余日未能拔城而撤军，张辽率军追击，后受拜征东将军。","events":["wudi-e-o177a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o009a-q","zhangle-e-o009b-q"]}]},{"id":"juchao","stage":"guard","title":"移屯居巢","time_events":["zhangle-e-o010a"],"sentences":[{"text":"曹操到合肥察看张辽作战之处，增其兵力，多留诸军，令其移屯居巢。","events":["zhangle-e-o010a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o010a-q"]}]},{"id":"general","stage":"wei","title":"前将军与晋阳侯","time_events":["zhangle-e-o012a","zhangle-e-o012c"],"sentences":[{"text":"曹丕即魏王位，任张辽为前将军，分封其兄及一子；称帝后封张辽为晋阳侯，增加食邑。","events":["zhangle-e-o012a","zhangle-e-o012c"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o012a-q","zhangle-e-o012c-q"]}]},{"id":"luoyang","stage":"wei","title":"朝见洛阳","time_events":["zhangle-e-o013a"],"sentences":[{"text":"张辽朝见洛阳宫，曹丕亲问破吴战事，为他建宅，又特为其母作殿；当年随他破吴的应募步卒皆列为虎贲。","events":["zhangle-e-o013a"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o013a-q"]}]},{"id":"death","stage":"wei","title":"患病与去世","time_events":["zhangle-e-o013b","zhangle-e-o013d"],"sentences":[{"text":"张辽在雍丘患病，曹丕遣刘晔带太医诊视，并亲临慰问；稍有好转后，张辽返回驻地。本传又记他与诸将击破吕范，随后病重，卒于江都，谥刚侯，子张虎继嗣。","events":["zhangle-e-o013b","zhangle-e-o013d"],"evidence":["zhangle-e-o013b-q","zhangle-e-o013d-q"]}]}],"placements":[{"event":"wudi-e-o057a","stage":"early"},{"event":"wudi-e-o074a","stage":"service"},{"event":"wudi-e-o115a","stage":"north"},{"event":"wudi-e-o177a","stage":"hefei"},{"event":"wudi-e-o185a","stage":"guard"},{"event":"wudi-e-o185b","stage":"guard"},{"event":"wudi-e-p153a","stage":"appraisal"},{"event":"xiahoucao-e-o043c","stage":"wei"},{"event":"cuimao-e-o070","stage":"service"},{"event":"liusima-e-o126","stage":"guard"},{"event":"liusima-e-o128","stage":"guard"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o001a","stage":"early"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o001b","stage":"early"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o001c","stage":"early"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o002a","stage":"early"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o002b","stage":"early"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o003a","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o003b","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o003c","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o004a","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o004b","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o004c","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o004d","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o004e","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-p001a","stage":"north"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o006a","stage":"north"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o007b","stage":"north"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o007c","stage":"north"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o008a","stage":"hefei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o008b","stage":"hefei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o010a","stage":"guard"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o011a","stage":"guard"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o012a","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o012b","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o012c","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o013a","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o013b","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o013c","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o013d","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-p003a","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o016a","stage":"service"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o024b","stage":"north"},{"event":"zhangle-e-o030c","stage":"north"},{"event":"hechang-e-e1761c7def3de6c7158d","stage":"service"},{"event":"xuhuwang-e-cfe6b2499af254ba05f6","stage":"guard"},{"event":"wgc-e-0-e9","stage":"wei"},{"event":"guanzhang-e-o004a","stage":"service"},{"event":"wuzhu-e-p012a","stage":"hefei"},{"event":"wuzhu-e-o057a","stage":"wei"},{"event":"wuzhu-e-p030b","stage":"wei"},{"event":"zhouyu-e-o078c","stage":"north"}],"compat":{"anchors":{"stage-revision-unversioned-service":"stage-early","stage-revision-0e19fc65-service":"stage-early","stage-revision-unversioned-hefei":"stage-hefei","stage-revision-0e19fc65-hefei":"stage-hefei"},"sources":{},"stage_groups":{"revision-unversioned-service":["early","service"],"revision-0e19fc65-service":["early","service"],"revision-unversioned-hefei":["hefei","guard"],"revision-0e19fc65-hefei":["hefei","guard"]}}}}},"directory_counts":{}}
